    "selected_artifact_scope": "Conversely, LLMs combined with coding- or solver-based strategies lack flexibility: they often generate problem-specific code from scratch or depend on fixed solvers, failing to capture generalizable logic across diverse problems.To alleviate these issues, we introduce the Scalable Code Planning Engine (SCOPE), a systematic framework that disentangles query-specific problem reasoning from generic code execution.",
